{
  "id": "E262",
  "title": "What Are You Drinking",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-10-13",
  "synopsis": "Lili likes to drink soy milk for breakfast.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/862/f8299cb9fe7b6c3f591f1066e48a930bb91113b9.mp3?1538292699",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你在喝什么\n\n本：早上好！你在喝什么？是牛奶吗？\n丽丽：早上好！这不是牛奶，这是豆浆。     \n本：豆浆是用什么做的？\n丽丽：豆浆是一种用黄豆做的饮料，很好喝。",
    "traditional": "你在喝什麼\n\n本：早上好！你在喝什麼？是牛奶嗎？\n麗麗：早上好！這不是牛奶，這是豆漿。     \n本：豆漿是用什麼做的？\n麗麗：豆漿是一種用黃豆做的飲料，很好喝。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What Are You Drinking"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：早上好！你在喝什么？是牛奶吗？",
      "traditional": "本：早上好！你在喝什麼？是牛奶嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn zǎo shang hǎo nǐ zài hē shén me shì niú nǎi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Good morning! What are you drinking? Is it milk?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：早上好！这不是牛奶，这是豆浆。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：早上好！這不是牛奶，這是豆漿。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zǎo shang hǎo zhè bú shì niú nǎi zhè shì dòu jiāng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "     \n",
      "traditional": "     \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Good morning! This is not milk. It is soy milk."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：豆浆是用什么做的？",
      "traditional": "本：豆漿是用什麼做的？",
      "pinyin": "běn dòu jiāng shì yòng shén me zuò de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What is soy milk made from?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：豆浆是一种用黄豆做的饮料，很好喝。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：豆漿是一種用黃豆做的飲料，很好喝。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì dòu jiāng shì yì zhǒng yòng huáng dòu zuò de yǐn liào hěn hǎo hē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Soy milk is a type of beverage made from yellow soybeans. It’s delicious."
    }
  ],
